    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "Thanks. I'm a bit worried about the p-value for the main correlation, though. It came in at 0.06. I don't want to lose the funding because of one slightly higher number. How should we phrase the evidence in the report so the reviewers see the strength of the connection without getting hung up on the technicality of it not hitting the 0.05 mark?",
